//! Coverage (spec 11, section 6): a program built covered, as `vun fuzz` builds one, sets the flag
//! of each block of its code in `map` as the block starts, the flag of the block's number modulo
//! `size`. `std.testing.fuzz` reads the flags to tell inputs apart by what they ran.

/// How many flags the map holds: blocks whose numbers meet modulo it share one.
size: usize = 8192;

/// The flags: 1 once a block of that number started, since the map was last cleared.
mut map: [size]u8 = [0; size];
